 "notes": "The house reef in front of Happy Life Village, south of Dahab (the site point is the hotel itself, about 450 m inland). Entry from the hotel beach by the jetty (OpenStreetMap); in front of it the reef flat, a sand slope with coral blocks and the drop-off from 25 to 55 m. The reef is the same stretch as Golden Blocks, whose entry is at the north-east end of the hotel beach (Mashraba is 5 km north in Dahab town); positions are approximate. No route is drawn.",
